This product bundles third-party open-source software from crates.io.
Each crate's license is listed in the app's Credits screen; the full set is
recorded in Cargo.lock.

Notable components:
    Typst (typesetting, PDF output)     Apache-2.0
    askama (HTML templates)             MIT OR Apache-2.0

Bundled typeface:
    IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Sans Condensed, Copyright 2017 IBM Corp.,
    with Reserved Font Name "Plex". SIL Open Font License 1.1; the full
    licence is in Assets/fonts/OFL.txt.

Lunar surface map:
    Adapted from the CGI Moon Kit color map (LRO LROC data), NASA's
    Scientific Visualization Studio, https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/4720.
    Used under NASA's media usage guidelines; no endorsement implied.
    Source in tools/moon/; baked by tools/moon/bake_albedo.py.

Bundled icons:
    Phosphor Icons, Copyright 2023 Phosphor Icons. MIT licence; the full
    licence is in crates/luna-app/ui/icons/LICENSE.

The earlier browser app (tag luna-web-final) and the retired .NET desktop app
(branch archive/dotnet, tag dotnet-final) carry their own NOTICE files.
